摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"External vision proxy extension for DeepSeek Harness, enabling text-only models to analyze and understand images via OpenAI-compatible vision APIs.","id":"gh:1339201380","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-ext-vision-proxy","slug":"jin123-alpha/dsh-ext-vision-proxy","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"External vision proxy extension for DeepSeek Harness, enabling text-only models to analyze and under"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"stand images via OpenAI-compatible vision APIs."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-ext-vision-proxy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> External vision proxy plugin for DeepSeek Harness, enabling text-only LLMs (such as DeepSeek-V3 / "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"DeepSeek-R1) to inspect, analyze, and understand images via OpenAI-compatible vision model APIs."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 📸 Screenshots"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"### 1. Settings Panel (Configuration & Provider Management)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 2. Chat Composer Switch (Pill-shaped Toggle & Model Selector)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🌟 Key Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **🖼️ Multimodal Power for Text-Only Models**: Allows text-only LLMs to autonomously invoke the `vi"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"sion_describe` tool to inspect and answer questions about images, screenshots, diagrams, and attachm"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ents.\n- **🔘 Native Composer Switch**: Integrates seamlessly into the chat input bar (`conversation.i"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"nput.left`) with a pill-shaped toggle switch and an interactive model dropdown selector.\n- **⚙️ Dedi"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"cated Settings & Connectivity Testing**: Provides an intuitive configuration panel in the Settings p"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"age supporting custom Base URLs, API Keys, vision model filtering, and one-click connectivity testin"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"g.\n- **🎛️ 4-State Session Matrix**:\n1. **Multimodal LLM + Switch ON**: `vision_describe` tool is vis"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"ible. Model can choose native or delegated recognition. Prompts confirmation dialog upon image attac"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"hment.\n2. **Multimodal LLM + Switch OFF**: Tool is stripped. Model processes images natively via sta"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"ndard DSH image messaging with zero proxy interference.\n3. **Text-only LLM + Switch ON**: Tool is vi"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"sible. Images are admitted without rejection; the LLM automatically invokes `vision_describe` with t"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"he attachment ID or file path.\n4. **Text-only LLM + Switch OFF**: Tool is invisible. Behavior is 100"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"% identical to not having the plugin installed.\n- **🔍 Intelligent Attachment & Image Resolution**: R"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"esolves content-addressed hashes (`sha256:...`), local file paths, HTTP/HTTPS URLs, and automaticall"},{"id":"p9s15","text":"y detects MIME types using binary magic bytes."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🏗️ Architecture"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Host (Node.js)**: `src/index.ts`\n- Registers the `vision_describe` tool schema and execution han"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"dler.\n- Dynamically filters tool exposure via the Cordis `system-prompt/assemble` waterfall hook bas"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ed on session state.\n- Exposes REST API endpoints on `webServer` for settings, model probing, and se"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ssion state sync.\n- **Client (React / Browser)**: `src/client/`\n- Registers the `settings.section` s"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"lot (`VisionSettingsSection`) for provider configuration.\n- Registers the `conversation.input.left` "},{"id":"p11s6","text":"slot (`VisionComposerButton`) for composer toggling and fast model switching."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 📦 Installation & Setup"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Option 1: Link in DSH Profile (Recommended for Development)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Add the dependency and bundle entry in your `~/.dsh/profiles/web/package.json`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option 2: Build & Pack"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 🚀 Getting Started"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. **Start DSH Web**:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"2. **Configure Vision API**:\n- Open DSH Web in your browser (`http://127.0.0.1:3080`).\n- Navigate to"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" **Settings -> 视觉代理 (Vision Proxy)**.\n- Enter your OpenAI-compatible Vision API Base URL (e.g., `htt"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ps://api.openai.com/v1` or local endpoint) and API Key.\n- Click **获取模型列表 (Fetch Models)** and select"},{"id":"p21s4","text":" your desired default vision model (e.g., `gpt-4o`, `gemini-2.5-flash`, `qwen-vl-max`).\n- Click **测试"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"连通性 (Test Connection)** to verify API connectivity, then save settings.\n3. **Chat & Inspect Images**"},{"id":"p21s6","text":":\n- In any conversation with DeepSeek-V3 or DeepSeek-R1, turn the **视觉代理** switch **ON**.\n- Upload o"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"r paste an image and ask questions (e.g., *\"What is shown in this image?\"*).\n- The LLM will call `vi"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"sion_describe` behind the scenes and respond with detailed answers."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT © 2026 Fan Yuejin"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
